    "ssh",
    "-i", keyPath,
    "-o", "IdentitiesOnly=yes", // fix
    "-o", "StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new",
    "-p", strconv.Itoa(port),
    host,
}
// or: bundle = ensureIdentitiesOnly(bundle)
```

For maximum DRY, all five builders can simply route through `ensureIdentitiesOnly(...)`; the explicit `-o IdentitiesOnly=yes` placement directly before `-i` in the literal slices is equivalent and self-documenting.

