**Guard side** (gitreins-style `guard/secrets.mjs`) — detects live credential shapes but explicitly allowlists fake placeholders, so legitimate CI stubs pass:

```js
// Live-key detector (flags sk-live-…, real sk-…, AKIA…, api_key=…)
re: /\bsk-(?!test-|fake-|placeholder-|your-|xxxx)[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]{19,}\b/g,
