No repo was present in the workspace, so I verified the fix against the **real `yjs` 13.6.32** wire format with a Node harness modeling the Go engine (apply + broker + broadcast), the TS provider (tree-scoped `EventSource` with credentials, binary push, snake_case→Yjs mapping), and the HTTP semantics of the handlers.

```
