- Preferred: run the dashboard on the default `:9876` (or set the config port) so CLI-routed live ACs work with no flag — this path is unchanged.
- Scratch-port harness (`:19876`): keep using `--dashboard-addr` — it now routes correctly instead of erroring.

Note on the evaluator note (b233b474, 5/5): with the routing fixed, the gitreins evaluator completes cleanly with no truncation; the "regression" was purely the address-resolution bug above.

