|-------|---|---|---|---|---|---|------|
| Before fix | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | 2/6 |
| After fix | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | **6/6** |

```
