  (${aU + aI} vs ${aA + aB})`);
  if (Math.abs(aX - (aA + aB - 2 * aI)) > TOL) fail(`${label}: |A△B| != |A|+|B|-2|A∩B| (${aX} vs ${aA + aB - 2 * aI})`);
  if (Math.abs(aD - (aA - aI)) > TOL) fail(`${label}: |A\\B| != |A|-|A∩B|`);
  if (Math.abs(aU - (aA + aB - aI)) > TOL) fail(`${label}: |A∪B| != |A|+|B|-|A∩B|`);

