- [ ] Fetching it as-is yields `200` + itinerary content
- [ ] Same path on the web origin is `404`
- [ ] `PUBLIC_BASE_URL` overrides all fallbacks
- [ ] Absent base reproduces the legacy relative value byte-for-byte; suite stays green

