rg -n "Date.now\(\)|typeof window" "apps/web/src/app/(student)/take-quiz/[id]/page.tsx"
```

Expected: both seeds use the fixed past constant; any remaining `Date.now()`/`typeof window` in `page.tsx` is inside `useEffect`.

### 4.4 SSR + hydration smoke test

```bash
