```

Reference run in `/tmp/raceverify` (real dirs, own uid/gid):

```
== RUN   TestEnsureInstallRuntimeDir
--- PASS: .../success_no_race
--- PASS: .../enoent_os_errnotexist_retry_succeeds
--- PASS: .../enoent_syscall_shape_retry_succeeds
--- PASS: .../combinedoutput_shape_retry_succeeds
