## Guarantees kept
- Non-recursive chown in both attempts (`gvfs` FUSE safe).
- INT-CI-008 ordering untouched.
- Exactly one retry, only for ENOENT teardown shape; `EPERM`/other errors fail on first call; second failure fails the spawn.
- No race ⇒ exactly one `MkdirAll` + one `chown`.

